Gives nano a second to put its key bindings back after a resize.

hasStandardBindings checks the first screen Bombadil samples after an
action, with next. After a resize, that screen can be taken before nano has
redrawn its bottom two lines. With eventually and a bound of one second,
the property holds once nano repaints, and still fails for a nano that
never shows the bindings, such as nano -x.

The lines it changes are Bombadil's examples/nano.ts, MIT-licensed. The
change is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, like the example.
The Dockerfile applies it to make nano-eventually.ts.

